#: lockout.cpp:320
msgid "Do you want to suspend to disk (hibernate)?"
msgstr "តើ​អ្នក​ចង់​ផ្អាក​ទៅ​ថាស​ដែរ​ឬទេ (សម្ងំ) ?"

